    <field name="scopecontent_teim">Holograph score for &#34;The Cabin,&#34; the first part of &#34;Last Supper at Uncle Tom&#39;s Cabin / The Promised Land.&#34; This large-scale composition was written for saxophone sextet, with extensive switching by each player. Individual movements include &#34;Cabin Opener&#34;; &#34;Harry&#34;; &#34;Liza - Tearful Farewell&#34;; &#34;George&#34;; &#34;Slave Dance&#34;; &#34;Chloe&#34;; &#34;Tom&#34;; &#34;Men&#39;s Chase / Haley&#39;s Dance&#34;; &#34;Tom&#39;s Goodbye&#34;; &#34;Boat Music&#34;; &#34;Slave&#39;s Walk&#34;; &#34;Lucy&#34;; &#34;St. Clair Family&#34;; &#34;Eva and Tom&#34;; &#34;Dixie Dance&#34;; &#34;Death of Eva&#34;; &#34;Auction&#34;; &#34;Tom&#39;s Whipping&#34;; &#34;Ghosts&#34;; &#34;Retrograde&#34;; &#34;Fanfare for Lincoln.&#34;</field>
